<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa lower, sugar breaks resistance.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa lower, sugar breaks resistance.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Lower, less active than seen recently, ACPC eyed. July $38 lower at $2,037 at midday break</p>
<p>COCOA - Dull. Weaker across the board. July nine stg lower at 1,015 stg</p>
<p>SUGAR - Firms. August pushes through $320 resistance on mostly outright, spread deals. August $1.30 up at $320.20 at 1132 GMT</p>
</text>
